 "words": 217,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Down from Galilee he came along the river road",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.63,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To the muddy Jordan where the crowds and waters flowed",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.64,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "John tried to stop him at the edge, for he knew who it must be",
   "heard": 15,
   "words": 15,
   "error_s": 0.67,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I need to be baptized by you, and yet you come to me",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.7,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Let it be so for now, the Teacher answered low",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.47,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To fulfill all righteousness, this is the way to go",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.69,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So John took him in the river, down beneath the stream",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.49,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And Jesus rose up out of it like waking from a dream",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.72,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "This is my beloved Son",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.32,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In whom I am well pleased",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Heaven opened, the Spirit came down",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.55,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Like a dove, like a dove",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.79,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The day after, John saw him walking on the shore",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.53,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And he called out to the people what he had come for",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.67,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Look, the Lamb of God, who takes away the sin of the world",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.31,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I have seen it, and I testify, he is the Chosen One of God",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 0.41,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "This is my beloved Son",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In whom I am well pleased",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.59,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Heaven opened, the Spirit came down",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.51,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Like a dove, like a dove",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.79,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And behold, the heavens were opened",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.72,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And he saw the Spirit of God descending like a dove",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
